<article class="card sk"><h3>Cloud and DevOps</h3><div class="tags"><span class="tag">AWS</span><span class="tag">Azure</span><span class="tag">Heroku</span><span class="tag">Git</span><span class="tag">Perforce</span><span class="tag">Jenkins</span><span class="tag">Docker</span></div></article>
<article class="card sk"><h3>Working style</h3><div class="tags"><span class="tag">Analytical thinking</span><span class="tag">Problem-solving</span><span class="tag">Teamwork</span><span class="tag">Documentation</span><span class="tag">Communication</span></div></article>
