<article class="card"><div class="mono">AWS</div><span class="k">Foundational</span><h3>AWS Certified Cloud Practitioner</h3><p>Amazon Web Services Training and Certification</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">Expires Mar 11, 2029</span><a class="tag" href="https://www.credly.com/earner/earned/badge/81560a28-3c06-49eb-9bfd-d610669392f1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View certificate</a></div></article>
